<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka's Hayleys Q1 net up 7 pct.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka's Hayleys Q1 net up 7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited first quarter results for the three months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>	    (in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>				  Q1 96/97	   Q1 95/96</p>
<p>    Net profit		   45.84   vs	 43.01</p>
<p>    Turnover		  1,651.06   vs    1,234.86</p>
<p>    Tax			    41.59  vs	  39.04</p>
<p>NOTE - Hayleys Ltd is one of three blue chip conglomerates listed in Colombo. --Colombo newsroom 941-434319</p>
</text>
